<p>Secretary of State, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Republican.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.harrisforsos.com" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (harrisforsos.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Says she is running to improve customer service at the secretary of state&#39;s office and build a faster, fairer experience for residents. She cites her experience with budgets, management, and customer relations from her corporate and elected roles.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Retired ComEd liability representative and small business owner from Joliet; serves as a Joliet Junior College trustee.</p>
